    "statement": "∀ {E : Type u_1}\n  [inst : NormedAddCommGroup E] [inst_1 : InnerProductSpace ℝ E] [inst_2 : FiniteDimensional ℝ E]\n  [inst_3 : MeasurableSpace E] [BorelSpace E] (μ : MeasureTheory.Measure E) [MeasureTheory.IsProbabilityMeasure μ]\n  (β κ η τ : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E) → ℝ),\n  Measurable β →\n    Measurable κ →\n      Measurable η →\n        Measurable τ →\n          (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)), 0 < β s) →\n            (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)), 0 < κ s) →\n              (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)), 0 ≤ η s) →\n                (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)), 0 < τ s) →\n                  ∀ (threshold : NNReal) (J : ℕ) (Δ : ℝ),\n                    0 ≤ Δ →\n                      have a := fun s => (η s + τ s) / β s;\n                      ∃ T H,\n                        ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel T ∧\n                          ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel H ∧\n                            (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)), T s = μ.tilted fun x => -(↑s.1 / 2) * ‖x - s.2.1‖ ^ 2) ∧\n                              (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                  H s =\n                                    AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.GaussianSmoothing.gaussianSmoothing (T s)\n                                      √(a s)) ∧\n                                ∀ (M L : ProbabilityTheory.Kernel (NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)) E),\n                                  ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel M →\n                                    ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel L →\n                                      (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                          ¬threshold ≤ s.1 →\n                                            AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.WassersteinSpace.wassersteinDistance\n                                                  (M s)\n                                                  (AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.GaussianSmoothing.gaussianSmoothing\n                                                    (T s) √(η s / β s)) ^\n                                                2 ≤\n                                              ENNReal.ofReal (κ s * (2 * τ s * Δ ^ 2 / (κ s * (↑J + 1))) / β s)) →\n                                        ∃ F Q P R,\n                                          (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)) (y : E),\n                                              ↑(F (s, y)).1 = ↑s.1 + (a s)⁻¹ ∧\n                                                (F (s, y)).2 =\n                                                  ((↑s.1 + (a s)⁻¹)⁻¹ • (↑s.1 • s.2.1 + (a s)⁻¹ • y), s.2.2.1 + 1,\n                                                    fun n => Nat.casesOn n y s.2.2.2)) ∧\n                                            ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel Q ∧\n                                              ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel P ∧\n                                                (∀ (n : ℕ), ProbabilityTheory.IsMarkovKernel (R n)) ∧\n                                                  (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                      Q s =\n                                                        AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.Measure.GaussianSmoothing.gaussianSmoothing\n                                                          (M s) √(τ s / β s)) ∧\n                                                    (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                        P s =\n                                                          if threshold ≤ s.1 then MeasureTheory.Measure.dirac s\n                                                          else MeasureTheory.Measure.map (fun y => F (s, y)) (Q s)) ∧\n                                                      R 0 = L ∧\n                                                        (∀ (n : ℕ) (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                            (R (n + 1)) s =\n                                                              if threshold ≤ s.1 then L s\n                                                              else (Q s).bind fun y => (R n) (F (s, y))) ∧\n                                                          (∀ (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                              ¬threshold ≤ s.1 →\n                                                                InformationTheory.klDiv (Q s) (H s) ≤\n                                                                  ENNReal.ofReal (Δ ^ 2 / (↑J + 1))) ∧\n                                                            ∀ (n : ℕ) (s : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                              InformationTheory.klDiv ((R n) s) (T s) ≤\n                                                                ↑n * ENNReal.ofReal (Δ ^ 2 / (↑J + 1)) +\n                                                                  ∫⁻ (x : NNReal × E × ℕ × (ℕ → E)),\n                                                                    InformationTheory.klDiv (L x) (T x) ∂(P ^ n) s",
    "statement_sha256": "a040867917b60efd228265e544a35ce99e810abb702fcd7308a1740ec8459914",
